# Keep the build context small and the image free of anything that is not the
# app. node_modules especially — `npm ci` reinstalls inside the image, and
# copying a host tree in can smuggle platform-specific binaries across.
# The context is the repository root so the workspace lockfile is available;
# only the manifests and apps/pwa reach the image (see apps/pwa/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dev-dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
docs
lat.md
apps/pwa/design-reference
apps/pwa/samples
apps/pwa/scripts
apps/pwa/playwright-report
apps/pwa/test-results
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
